 the Seine, the scene of riots this weekend.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/02/world/europe/france-yellow-vest-protests.html', 'snippet': 'With little organization, fueled by frustration, the protests have moved from poor rural regions to the banks of the Seine, the scene of riots this weekend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GUÉRET, France — At the bare bottom of Florian Dou’s shopping cart at the discount supermarket, there was a packet of $6 sausages and not much else. It was the end of last week, and the end of last month. At that point, “my salary and my wife’s have been gone for 10 days,” he lamented.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/03/world/03france3-promo/03france3-promo-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/03/world/03france3-promo/03france3-promo-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/03/world/03france3-promo/03france3-promo-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/03/world/03france3-promo/03france3-promo-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/03/world/03france3-promo/03france3-promo-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/03/world/03france3-promo/03france3-promo-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/03/world/03france3-promo/03france3-promo-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Yellow Vests’ Riot in Paris, but Their Anger Is Rooted Deep in France', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Riots Roil Paris, but Ire Is Rooted Deep in France', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Yellow Vests Movement', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Macron, Emmanuel (1977- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gueret (France)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-02T23:58:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Nossiter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nossiter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f02b33e-94f3-5d46-9fa9-71e3c50ac84a', 'word_count': 1847, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f02b33e-94f3-5d46-9fa9-71e3c50ac84a'}, {'abstract': 'The possibilities ahead in the Russia investigation suggest we are not reaching the end of a nightmare, but rather entering one. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/02/opinion/trump-mueller-russia-investigation.html', 'snippet': 'The possibilities ahead in the Russia investigation suggest we are not reaching the end of a nightmare, but rather entering one. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'I no longer