n a shrewd business move, the rapper Travis Scott used T-shirts, key chains and beach towels — each of which happened to come with a copy of his album — to return to the top, while simultaneously earning a No. 1 Billboard single.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/arts/04billboard/merlin_147418968_a236cb69-b825-4f18-8056-e8f8eced2d76-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/04/arts/04billboard/merlin_147418968_a236cb69-b825-4f18-8056-e8f8eced2d76-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/arts/04billboard/merlin_147418968_a236cb69-b825-4f18-8056-e8f8eced2d76-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/arts/04billboard/merlin_147418968_a236cb69-b825-4f18-8056-e8f8eced2d76-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1514, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/arts/04billboard/merlin_147418968_a236cb69-b825-4f18-8056-e8f8eced2d76-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/04/arts/04billboard/merlin_147418968_a236cb69-b825-4f18-8056-e8f8eced2d76-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/arts/04billboard/merlin_147418968_a236cb69-b825-4f18-8056-e8f8eced2d76-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Travis Scott Tops 6ix9ine on His Way to a No. 1 Album and Single in the Same Week', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Travis Scott Tops Two Billboard Charts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': '6ix9ine (Rapper)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Travis (1992- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Astroworld (Album)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Dummy Boy (Album)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-03T20:27:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Coscarelli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Coscarelli', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/017ad1a9-7355-5e6d-b1e9-2a727f386d25', 'word_count': 500, 'uri': 'nyt://article/017ad1a9-7355-5e6d-b1e9-2a727f386d25'}, {'abstract': 'The appetizing emporium opens a new bagel shop in Park Slope, Brooklyn, with bagels and pletzels, a kind of large, flattened bialy covered with onions and poppy seeds. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/03/dining/shelskys-bagels-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'The appetizing emporium opens a new bagel shop in Park Slope, Brooklyn, with bagels and pletzels, a kind of large, flattened bialy covered with onions and poppy seeds. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Shelsky’s latest venture, it’s all about the bagels. At their new Park Slope location, the owners Peter Shelsky and Lewis Spada have brought on Matthew Tilden, who was at Scratchbread in Bedford-Stuyvesant, to bake bagels that, while quite plump, are denser, chewier and crisper than the usual examples of the genre. The partners are especially proud of their cracked pepper and salt bagel, their whole-grain bagel and their pletzel, a kind of large, flattened bialy covered with onions and poppy seeds. Shelsky’s smoked fish and other deli items fill the display cases. Bagel and bialy sandwiches are available, along with fried knish pastry filled with hot pastrami, sauerkraut and mustard. It’s food to go; seating is minimal.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner9/merlin_147517797_941c3a0e-c6d0-4a26-b8f8-3ea9217b196e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner9/merlin_147517797_941c3a0e-c6d0-4a26-b8f8-3ea9217b196e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner9/merlin_147517797_941c3a0e-c6d0-4a26-b8f8-3ea9217b196e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner9/merlin_147517797_941c3a0e-c6d0-4a26-b8f8-3ea9217b196e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner9/05burner9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner9/05burner9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner9/05burner9-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Shelsky’s Branches Into Bagels', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Shop: Shelsky’s Branches  Into Bagels', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bagels', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Shelsky's of Brooklyn", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Park Slope (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-03T20:36:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4870ac68-6fd9-5ef7-9bad-f0ef7d505f4c', 'word_count': 156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4870ac68-6fd9-5ef7-9bad-f0ef7d505f4c'}, {'abstract': 'The cookbook “Avocaderia” contains multiple recipes for avocado toast, plus ideas for pancakes, drinks and desserts starring the avocado.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/03/dining/avocaderia-book.html', 'snippet': 'The cookbook “Avocaderia” contains multiple recipes for avocado toast, plus ideas for pancakes, drinks and desserts starring the avocado.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Do avocados make me happy? Yes, when I have a margarita to sip. And considering the success of the improbably avocado-loving restaurant Avocaderia (with locations in Industry City, Brooklyn, and Chelsea, Manhattan), avocados surely bring joy to Alessandro Biggi, Francesco Brachetti and Alberto Gramigni, the partners in the venture. Their book tells you all about the avocado and provides recipes in which puréed avocado quietly lurks (pancake batter, banana cake, crab cakes) or struts out front (many toasts, Caesar salad, frozen paleta bars). There’s even a step-by-step guide to making an avocado “rose.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner3/merlin_146762409_093700f9-e58a-4770-8e8a-68716e21daf1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner3/merlin_146762409_093700f9-e58a-4770-8e8a-68716e21daf1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 766}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner3/merlin_146762409_093700f9-e58a-4770-8e8a-68716e21daf1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 803, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner3/merlin_146762409_093700f9-e58a-4770-8e8a-68716e21daf1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1605, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner3/05burner3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner3/05burner3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner3/05burner3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Avocado Toast, of Course, but So Much More', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Inspire: Avocado Toast, of Course, But So Much More', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Avocados', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biggi, Alessandro', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brachetti, Francesco', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fabricant, Florence', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Avocaderia: Avocado Recipes for a Healthier, Happier Life (Book)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-03T20:38:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/937d2f31-5671-5489-b92c-d5649f5aae09', 'word_count': 138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/937d2f31-5671-5489-b92c-d5649f5aae09'}, {'abstract': 'At the Museum at Eldridge Street, rare menorahs from around the world are on display for the holiday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/03/dining/menorahs-museum-at-eldridge-street.html', 'snippet': 'At the Museum at Eldridge Street, rare menorahs from around the world are on display for the holiday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are countless menorahs, the candelabras designed for Hanukkah, when the eight candles are lit, night by night, with blessings and the shamash, or “helper candle.” Starting Dec. 6, the museum in the historic Eldridge Street Synagogue will give you some idea of the variety. Scores of menorahs from the private collection of Aharon Ben Zalman — from countries across the globe and including some from colonial America, 16th-century Italy and modern India — will be on view for several months.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner4/merlin_147389337_ae572a03-c576-4506-a235-617c4655fa35-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner4/merlin_147389337_ae572a03-c576-4506-a235-617c4655fa35-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner4/merlin_147389337_ae572a03-c576-4506-a235-617c4655fa35-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner4/merlin_147389337_ae572a03-c576-4506-a235-617c4655fa35-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1308, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner4/merlin_147389337_ae572a03-c576-4506-a235-617c4655fa35-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner4/merlin_147389337_ae572a03-c576-4506-a235-617c4655fa35-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner4/merlin_147389337_ae572a03-c576-4506-a235-617c4655fa35-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Celebrating the Menorahs That Hold the Hanukkah Lights', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Admire: Celebrating Menorahs From Around the World', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hanukkah', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eldridge Street Synagogue (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canal Street (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-03T20:40:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dbd514b0-7444-5afe-80b6-f2b79436aac4', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dbd514b0-7444-5afe-80b6-f2b79436aac4'}, {'abstract': 'Ridge Vineyards has released some of its Monte Bello, a Bordeaux blend, online.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/03/dining/drinks/ridge-vineyards-monte-bello.html', 'snippet': 'Ridge Vineyards has released some of its Monte Bello, a Bordeaux blend, online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are many commendable California cabs, but my favorite is Ridge Monte Bello, a Bordeaux blend from a vineyard in the Santa Cruz Mountains that’s predominantly cabernet sauvignon. This fall, the winery — which is best known for its zinfandels and is extremely selective when it comes to making its signature Monte Bello available — offered bottles of its highly rated 2015 online. I dug deep into my pocket and bought some. It’s a consistent classic. Sleek and balanced between the tension of its acidity and the richness of its fruit, the wine is deliciously drinkable now but also ready to hibernate for many years in your cellar. It is the perfect gift for a discerning wine lover who is not seduced by hype or cult.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner7/merlin_147445488_be7a230c-808d-453b-be3c-c3b80dd900c6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner7/merlin_147445488_be7a230c-808d-453b-be3c-c3b80dd900c6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 771}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner7/merlin_147445488_be7a230c-808d-453b-be3c-c3b80dd900c6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 797, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner7/merlin_147445488_be7a230c-808d-453b-be3c-c3b80dd900c6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1594, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner7/05burner7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner7/05burner7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/dining/05burner7/05burner7-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 