r holiday debut as parents, I informed my wife that we would be celebrating the season not only with Santa Claus but also with Hanukkah Harry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My wife was raised Catholic with a big C, and I was raised Jewish with a small j. As a tacit compromise, we are bringing up our daughter with such godlessness that when visiting my in-laws’ home, she mistook the crosses hanging in each room for light switches. Nonetheless, come December, there is but one figure who reigns supreme among her set: he of the ho ho hos.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/opinion/05ruttenberg-illo/05ruttenberg-illo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/05/opinion/05ruttenberg-illo/05ruttenberg-illo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 704}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/opinion/05ruttenberg-illo/05ruttenberg-illo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 873, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/opinion/05ruttenberg-illo/05ruttenberg-illo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1746, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/opinion/05ruttenberg-illo/05ruttenberg-illo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/05/opinion/05ruttenberg-illo/05ruttenberg-illo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/opinion/05ruttenberg-illo/05ruttenberg-illo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'That’s One Alternative Santa', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'That’s One Alternative Santa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Santa Claus', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hanukkah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lovitz, Jon', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Saturday Night Live (TV Program)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-05T00:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jay Ruttenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruttenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5b7f6ec-a656-5e98-a77f-f889910aebb1', 'word_count': 1039, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5b7f6ec-a656-5e98-a77f-f889910aebb1'}, {'abstract': 'How do we govern in the age that will begin with the 2020 election? ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/04/opinion/the-next-america.html', 'snippet': 'How do we govern in the age that will begin with the 2020 election? ', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have this feeling that the 2020 presidential election in the United States will be unlike any in my lifetime — and not only because it will likely involve Donald Trump running as an incumbent — he alone is a one-man, three-ring circus — but also because the huge issue that should have been the focus of the 2016 election will be unavoidable by 2020. That is: How do we govern the “Next America’’?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/opinion/04friedmanWeb/merlin_139119339_aa9c74e3-0d4e-4d31-a7da-c17ace51643b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/04/opinion/04friedmanWeb/merlin_139119339_aa9c74e3-0d4e-4d31-a7da-c17ace51643b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/opinion/04friedmanWeb/merlin_139119339_aa9c74e3-0d4e-4d31-a7da-c17ace51643b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/opinion/04friedmanWeb/merlin_139119339_aa9c74e3-0d4e-4d31-a7da-c17ace51643b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/opinion/04friedmanWeb/04friedmanWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/04/opinion/04friedmanWeb/04friedmanWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/04/opinion/04friedmanWeb/04friedmanWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The ‘Next America’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Next America, A New Age, Starts in 2020', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antitrust Laws and Competition Issues', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Artificial Intelligence', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AT&T Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Verizon Communications Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zuckerberg, Mark E', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Driverless and Semiautonomous Vehicles', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WhatsApp Inc', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tennessee', 'rank': 17, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-05T00:09:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas L. Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/51598d46-165b-51f5-a730-ee55f028a32f', 'word_count': 1148, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51598d46-165b-51f5-a730-ee55f028a32f'}, {'abstract': 'The billionaire philanthropist, appearing in Iowa