entions to compete for a playoff spot in 2019 after two losing seasons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/04/sports/robinson-cano-edwin-diaz-mets.html', 'snippet': 'Robinson Cano, 36, and Edwin Diaz, 24, were introduced after a deal that signaled the Mets’ intentions to compete for a playoff spot in 2019 after two losing seasons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Edwin Diaz was at home in his native Puerto Rico last week when buzz about a potential blockbuster trade that would send him and his Seattle Mariners’ teammate, Robinson Cano, to the Mets fluttered across social media. By Friday, the trade was in mostly in place. That night, Cano, who was in his native Dominican Republic, called Diaz.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/sports/05METSprint1/merlin_147720033_a8e86710-0d87-4d63-adf5-5a4255c63def-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/05/sports/05METSprint1/merlin_147720033_a8e86710-0d87-4d63-adf5-5a4255c63def-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/sports/05METSprint1/merlin_147720033_a8e86710-0d87-4d63-adf5-5a4255c63def-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/sports/05METSprint1/merlin_147720033_a8e86710-0d87-4d63-adf5-5a4255c63def-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/sports/05METSprint1/05METSprint1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'he