y runners might expect. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/05/well/move/nike-vaporfly-4-shoe-may-make-some-run-faster.html', 'snippet': 'Wearing the shoes makes runners more efficient than wearing other shoes, although not for the reasons many runners might expect. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The distinctive and controversial Nike Vaporfly 4% running shoe is supposed to improve running ease and speed by as much as 4 percent, as its name suggests. Two new laboratory studies of the shoes suggest that those claims are credible.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/well/physed-shoe/merlin_143808264_ca2d42b1-e700-4beb-8a84-5840c0396981-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/11/well/physed-shoe/merlin_143808264_ca2d42b1-e700-4beb-8a84-5840c0396981-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/well/physed-shoe/merlin_143808264_ca2d42b1-e700-4beb-8a84-5840c0396981-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/well/physed-shoe/merlin_143808264_ca2d42b1-e700-4beb-8a84-5840c0396981-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1417, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/well/physed-shoe/merlin_143808264_ca2d42b1-e700-4beb-8a84-5840c0396981-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/11/well/physed-shoe/m