s', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5e70ac1-c86b-5dc0-a9ea-c75baa98a9b6', 'word_count': 1127, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5e70ac1-c86b-5dc0-a9ea-c75baa98a9b6'}, {'abstract': 'Are you more likely to dwell on failures than your successes?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/05/learning/do-you-give-yourself-enough-credit-for-your-own-successes.html', 'snippet': 'Are you more likely to dwell on failures than your successes?', 'lead_paragraph': 'You just had a big win: You studied hard and aced a big test; you finally mastered a difficult piano piece; you improved your personal best time. Do you take a victory lap? Do you seek out praise? Do you quietly move on?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/smarter-living/07sl-kudos-image/04sl-kudos-image-articleLarge.gif', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/07/smarter-living/07sl-kudos-image/04sl-kudos-image-articleLarge.gif', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/smarter-living/07sl-kudos-image/04sl-kudos-image-jumbo.gif', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/smarter-living/07sl-kudos-image/04sl-kudos-image-superJumbo.gif', 'height': 1800, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/smarter-living/07sl-kudos-image/04sl-kudos-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/07/smarter-living/07sl-kudos-image/04sl-kudos-i