e, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/books/review/09Greif/09Greif-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Was Saul Bellow a Man or a Jerk? Both, a Monumental Biography Concludes', 'kicker': 'Nonfiction', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Jerk', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bellow, Saul', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-05T10:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Greif', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Greif', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/3132d079-d02f-5754-ab9c-cea992dfc29b', 'word_count': 1369, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3132d079-d02f-5754-ab9c-cea992dfc29b'}, {'abstract': 'President Trump grew up during the Cold War but has gleefully tried to dismantle the European and global institutions that Mr. Bush and his Cold War-vintage colleagues built.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/05/us/politics/george-bush-cold-war.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump grew up during the Cold War but has gleefully tried to dismantle the European and global institutions that Mr. Bush and his Cold War-vintage colleagues built.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — On Sept. 16, 1991, Angela Merkel, then a young protégé of Chancellor Helmut Kohl of Germany, watched in the Oval Office as her boss and President George Bush wrestled with the sudden collapse of the Soviet Union. Without an influx of emergency aid, Germans feared that refugees could pour across the border, threatening the stability of their newly reunified country.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/us/06dc-coldwargen1/06dc-coldwargen1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/06/us/06dc-coldwargen1/06dc-coldwargen1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/us/06dc-coldwargen1/06dc-coldwargen1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/us/06dc-coldwargen1/06dc-coldwargen1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/us/06dc-coldwargen1/06dc-coldwargen1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/06/us/06dc-coldwargen1/06dc-coldwargen1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/us/06dc-coldwargen1/06dc-coldwargen1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mourning Not Just George Bush’s Death, but the World Order He Helped Build', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Recalling a Global Order Bush Helped Construct', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cold War Era', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Group of Twenty', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Trade Organization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gorbachev, Mikhail S', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kohl, Helmut', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kornblum, John C', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merkel, Angela', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Buenos Aires (Argentina)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-05T10:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/778c8a49-6115-5332-aa70-47d22aca37b1', 'word_count': 1109, 'uri': 'nyt://article/778c8a49-6115-5332-aa70-47d22aca37b1'}, {'abstract': 'After my husband suffered a traumatic brain injury while deployed in Afghanistan, our family was never the same.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/05/magazine/military-caregiver-ptsd-family.html', 'snippet': 'After my husband suffered a traumatic brain injury while deployed in Afghanistan, our family was never the same.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago, my son, who is now 14, erupted in anger and stormed off to his bedroom. He’d been having frequent fits of rage and anxiety, yelling and throwing things around the house or simply breaking down in tears. During his latest one, I was startled by how his tantrum abruptly fell silent. His bedroom was eerily quiet. I listened at his door knowing that he couldn’t have calmed himself so quickly. I was terrified to walk into the room and find my son dead.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/magazine/05atwar-ptsd/05atwar-ptsd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/05/magazine/05atwar-ptsd/05atwar-ptsd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/magazine/05atwar-ptsd/05atwar-ptsd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/magazine/05atwar-ptsd/05atwar-ptsd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/magazine/05atwar-ptsd/05atwar-ptsd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/05/magazine/05atwar-ptsd/05atwar-ptsd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/magazine/05atwar-ptsd/05atwar-ptsd-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'My Husband Was Hurt by an I.E.D. The Lasting Injury Was to Our Family.', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Marine Corps', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traumatic Brain Injury', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Improvised Explosive Devices', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-05T10:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liz Rotenberry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rotenberry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/946aef00-a592-513c-943e-619ac47b3fa6', 'word_count': 1522, 'uri': 'nyt://article/946aef00-a592-513c-943e-619ac47b3fa6'}, {'abstract': 'Tips and strategies for singles and families who want to enjoy warm weather on a sandy beach or on the deck of a cruise ship, and still not pay too much.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/05/travel/09frugal-islands-budget-travel-tips.html', 'snippet': 'Tips and strategies for singles and families who want to enjoy warm weather on a sandy beach or on the deck of a cruise ship, and still not pay too much.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Birds fly south for the winter, and why shouldn’t you? With the approaching cold weather, it’s time to fire up the laptop and start planning that much-deserved vacation. Whether you’re single or coupled up, traveling solo or with children in tow, everyone has more or less the same goal: Escape to some temporary warmth while maximizing enjoyment and minimizing cost. Here are a few tips I’ve compiled for those seeking sun this coming winter, be it on a cruise ship or a quick getaway to a tropical island.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/travel/09frugal3/merlin_119593697_94d72c13-8055-47d0-b308-e7223cda2b67-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/09/travel/09frugal3/merlin_119593697_94d72c13-8055-47d0-b308-e7223cda2b67-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/travel/09frugal3/merlin_119593697_94d72c13-8055-47d0-b308-e7223cda2b67-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/travel/09frugal3/merlin_119593697_94d72c13-8055-47d0-b308-e7223cda2b67-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/travel/09frugal3/09frugal3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/09/travel/09frugal3/09frugal3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/travel/09frugal3/09frugal3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Basking in the Sun This Winter, for Less', 'kicker': 'frugal traveler', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ride Toward Sun’s Warmth on the Back of Discounts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budget 