 them to cushion the blow on the most vulnerable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/06/world/europe/france-fuel-carbon-tax.html', 'snippet': 'There is little doubt among scientists and economists that carbon taxes are needed to reduce fossil fuel dependence. The question is how to design them to cushion the blow on the most vulnerable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Vincent Picard describes himself as a “militant ecologist.” But when protesters took to the streets to express their rage over a planned increase in France’s fuel tax, Mr. Picard joined their ranks.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/world/07france-climate1/merlin_147578235_8c0d237a-3fbc-4d66-8ce9-c4e696ea7631-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 424, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/07/world/07france-climate1/merlin_147578235_8c0d237a-3fbc-4d66-8ce9-c4e696ea7631-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 424}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/world/07france-climate1/merlin_147578235_8c0d237a-3fbc-4d66-8ce9-c4e696ea7631-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/world/07france-climate1/merlin_147578235_8c0d237a-3fbc-4d66-8ce9-c4e696ea7631-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1448, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/world/07france-climate1/merlin_147578235_8c0d237a-3fbc-4d66-8ce9-c4e696ea7631-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 't