, 'word_count': 249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/207c220b-ca44-5bbb-9b65-24db52926357'}, {'abstract': 'The actor and producer donated $432,635 to pay off layaway accounts at two Atlanta-area stores, days after the Saints’ owner paid shoppers’ debts in New Orleans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/06/us/saints-gayle-benson-walmart-layaway.html', 'snippet': 'The actor and producer donated $432,635 to pay off layaway accounts at two Atlanta-area stores, days after the Saints’ owner paid shoppers’ debts in New Orleans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Walmart shoppers visited their local stores this week, some walked out with a holiday surprise. On Thursday, the actor and producer Tyler Perry announced on Instagram that he would pay off layaway accounts in two stores in the Atlanta region, totaling $432,635. Days earlier, Gayle Benson, a billionaire philanthropist and owner of the New Orleans Saints, donated $93,502 to pay off accounts for 408 customers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/arts/07xp-saints-perry/07xp-saints-perry-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/07/arts/07xp-saints-perry/07xp-saints-perry-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/arts/07xp-saints-perry/07xp-saints-perry-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/07/arts/07xp-saints-perry/07xp-saints-perry-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '