ats meet in Poland for high-stakes climate negotiations, a pitched standoff between the United States and China threatens to slow global action on climate change precisely at a time when the risks of catastrophe are accelerating. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/climate/00CLI-USCHINA1/00CLI-USCHINA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/06/climate/00CLI-USCHINA1/00CLI-USCHINA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/climate/00CLI-USCHINA1/00CLI-USCHINA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/climate/00CLI-USCHINA1/00CLI-USCHINA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/climate/00CLI-USCHINA1/00CLI-USCHINA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/06/climate/00CLI-USCHINA1/00CLI-USCHINA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/06/climate/00CLI-USCHINA1/00CLI-USCHINA1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S.-China Friction Threatens to Undercut the Fight Against Climate Change', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Climate Efforts Sputter as U.S. and China Duel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coal', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Renewable Energy', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-07T10:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Climate', 'section_name': 'Climate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/583b133b-29a6-5c77-9a93-0fcedaf1ec7e', 'word_count': 1129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/583b133b-29a6-5c77-9a93-0fcedaf1ec7e'}, {'abstract': 'She runs up to 15 miles in Riverside Park, often goes for costume fittings, enjoys guacamole and margaritas with friends, and calls her parents.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/07/nyregion/how-alyson-cambridge-operatic-soprano-spends-her-sundays.html', 'snippet': 'She runs up to 15 miles in Riverside Park, often goes for costume fittings, enjoys guacamole and margaritas with friends, and calls her parents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alyson Cambridge made her debut at the Metropolitan Opera in 2004 when she was 24. She has performed there regularly ever since while also appearing on European stages with the Polish National Opera and the Munich Philharmonic. This year, Ms. Cambridge, 39, made her Broadway debut in the musical “Rocktopia” and released her third album, “Sisters in Song,” a collaboration with her longtime friend and colleague Nicole Cabell. The album is a mix of opera duets, classical songs and African-American spirituals. She lives on the Upper West Side.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE1/merlin_143684628_c3f9ca3a-f485-4bf3-90ff-b4fe3a5c969b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE1/merlin_143684628_c3f9ca3a-f485-4bf3-90ff-b4fe3a5c969b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE1/merlin_143684628_c3f9ca3a-f485-4bf3-90ff-b4fe3a5c969b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE1/merlin_143684628_c3f9ca3a-f485-4bf3-90ff-b4fe3a5c969b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE1/09ROUTINE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE1/09ROUTINE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE1/09ROUTINE1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How Alyson Cambridge, Operatic Soprano, Spends Her Sundays', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Run 15 Miles, Then Warm the Vocal Cords', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Opera', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Upper West Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cambridge, Alyson', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-07T10:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metropolitan', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shivani Vora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shivani', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vora', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c23efcf-e68e-596a-9714-73edc3867c3c', 'word_count': 812, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c23efcf-e68e-596a-9714-73edc3867c3c'}, {'abstract': 'The creators of the show take a look back in time with us. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/07/arts/television/mrs-maisel-photos-new-york-locations.html', 'snippet': 'The creators of the show take a look back in time with us. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'It would have been so easy for the creators of “The Marvelous Mrs. Maisel” to get it all wrong. We’ve all seen New York through the eyes of the Hollywood dream machine in a way that could not fool us, the native New Yorkers. We’ve scowled at streets that were supposed to be Harlem but were clearly a backlot in Burbank, Calif. We’ve shook our heads at shimmering skyscrapers that were meant to be the financial district but were obviously Toronto or Vancouver. And perhaps the worst: We’ve watched characters who are not part of the Marvel Cinematic Universe hop on a subway in TriBeCa and arrive, moments later, in Washington Heights. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/12/arts/07maisel-ast4-p3/merlin_147492627_c6347845-1d9c-4239-bf19-170507df62c0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/12/arts/07maisel-ast4-p3/merlin_147492627_c6347845-1d9c-4239-bf19-170507df62c0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/12/arts/07maisel-ast4-p3/merlin_147492627_c6347845-1d9c-4239-bf19-170507df62c0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/12/arts/07maisel-ast4-p3/merlin_147492627_c6347845-1d9c-4239-bf19-170507df62c0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/12/arts/07maisel-ast4-p3/07maisel-ast4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/12/arts/07maisel-ast4-p3/07maisel-ast4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/12/arts/07maisel-ast4-p3/07maisel-ast4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'leg