 'nyt://article/9e384a14-e6d7-57f8-bc58-a6d89d1da6e0'}, {'abstract': 'To boast, to flatter, to deceive others, to deceive himself, out of habit — or perhaps just because.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/08/opinion/sunday/paul-manafort-lies.html', 'snippet': 'To boast, to flatter, to deceive others, to deceive himself, out of habit — or perhaps just because.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Maybe Paul Manafort simply has more chutzpah than the rest of us. Here’s a man convicted of financial fraud, facing further criminal prosecution for the lies he’s accused of telling, who makes a deal to protect himself and proceeds, according to a memo sent to a federal judge on Friday, to lie to the prosecutors. Accused of lying, he offers as evidence in his defense … what appear to be more lies. There are no good reasons to believe him, and yet he seems to brashly lie nevertheless. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/10/opinion/09martin-01/09martin-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/10/opinion/09martin-01/09martin-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/10/opinion/09martin-01/09martin-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/10/opinion/09martin-01/09martin-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/10/opinion/09martin-01/09martin-01-thumbSta