st. He despises what Jeff Bezos built, but he can’t quit it. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/08/opinion/sunday/hate-amazon-try-living-without-it.html', 'snippet': 'My dad was a longtime labor activist. He despises what Jeff Bezos built, but he can’t quit it. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sharing an Amazon Prime account with loved ones is surprisingly intimate. You’re privy to one another’s impulse buys, fondness for corny ’90s comedies and preferred brands of vaginal suppositories. Like many families, mine shares a login for the ubiquitous delivery behemoth. Every time my dad or my sister orders an item, I see a cheerful red badge pop up on my app: “Your Amazon.com shipment is on its way!”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/opinion/09willisaronowitz/merlin_145495980_3dcd0843-b8bf-463f-805c-0607d85fe36e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/09/opinion/09willisaronowitz/merlin_145495980_3dcd0843-b8bf-463f-805c-0607d85fe36e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/opinion/09willisaronowitz/merlin_145495980_3dcd0843-b8bf-463f-805c-0607d85fe36e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/opinion/09willisaronowitz/merlin_145495980_3dcd0843-b8bf-463f-805c-0607d85fe36e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/opinion/09willisaronowitz/0