be a real battle for the title.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/08/sports/soccer-manchester-city-chelsea.html', 'snippet': 'A 2-0 loss to Chelsea actually puts Liverpool atop the Premier League, at least for the moment. And perhaps there will be a real battle for the title.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — For 44 minutes, Chelsea chased. Dutifully, doggedly, Maurizio Sarri’s players trailed after Manchester City, after the ball. They tracked runs. They shuttled from one side of the Stamford Bridge field to the other. They cleared crosses and intercepted passes, and they thumped the ball away, as far as it would go. Then they caught their breath, strained their sinews and got ready to do it all again.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/sports/09onsoccer-1/merlin_147888666_7eef3250-d035-4f18-8cec-d3964150850c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/09/sports/09onsoccer-1/merlin_147888666_7eef3250-d035-4f18-8cec-d3964150850c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/sports/09onsoccer-1/merlin_147888666_7eef3250-d035-4f18-8cec-d3964150850c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/sports/09onsoccer-1/merlin_147888666_7eef3250-d035-4f18-8cec-d3964150850c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1282, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/09/sports/09onsoccer-1/09onsoccer-1-thu