rd_count': 175, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81cd4930-ffa1-5048-8106-2ae56de71d54'}, {'abstract': 'Her device freed secretaries from the typewriter. But as word processing became ubiquitous, it helped eliminate their jobs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/10/obituaries/evelyn-berezin-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Her device freed secretaries from the typewriter. But as word processing became ubiquitous, it helped eliminate their jobs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Evelyn Berezin, a computer pioneer who emancipated many a frazzled secretary from the shackles of the typewriter nearly a half-century ago by building and marketing the first computerized word processor, died on Saturday in Manhattan. She was 93.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2000/12/30/obituaries/30notable-berezin/merlin_147974826_db73edff-1dd8-4d48-be17-450dcaa690bc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2000/12/30/obituaries/30notable-berezin/merlin_147974826_db73edff-1dd8-4d48-be17-450dcaa690bc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2000/12/30/obituaries/30notable-berezin/merlin_147974826_db73edff-1dd8-4d48-be17-450dcaa690bc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2000/12/30/obituaries/30notable-berezin/merlin_147974826_db73edff-1dd8-4d48-be17-450dcaa690bc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2000/12/30/obituaries/30n