rant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He spent much of his time in his mother’s basement and in his bedroom with blacked-out windows, essentially turning into the “homebound recluse” a psychiatrist who had evaluated him feared he could become. He obsessed over violence, culling together an elaborate spreadsheet documenting decades of mass killings. His worldview appeared bleak in interactions with others.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/nyregion/11sandyhook01/merlin_76178614_a12ed403-a30e-48a3-af75-bc063920c51d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/11/nyregion/11sandyhook01/merlin_76178614_a12ed403-a30e-48a3-af75-bc063920c51d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/nyregion/11sandyhook01/merlin_76178614_a12ed403-a30e-48a3-af75-bc063920c51d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/nyregion/11sandyhook01/merlin_76178614_a12ed403-a30e-48a3-af75-bc063920c51d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/nyregion/11sandyhook01/11sandyhook01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/11/nyregion/11sandyhook01/11sandyhook01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/nyregion/11sandyhook01/11sandyhook01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Newly Released Documents Detail Sandy Hook Shooter’s Troubled State of Mind', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sandy Hook Killer Wrote Of His ‘Scorn for Humanity’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'School Shootings and Armed Attacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sandy Hook Elementary School (Newtown, Conn)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lanza, Adam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Newtown (Conn)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-11T00:26:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Rojas and Kristin Hussey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rojas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Kristin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hussey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d233c3b-dd0b-5ced-979d-33686cd9f69f', 'word_count': 1083, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d233c3b-dd0b-5ced-979d-33686cd9f69f'}, {'abstract': 'Donald Trump, Mitt Romney, Meg Whitman, Pete Wilson, and Dianne Feinstein are just a few of the public officials who have been forced to acknowledge that they employed undocumented immigrants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/10/us/politicians-undocumented-immigrant-workers.html', 'snippet': 'Donald Trump, Mitt Romney, Meg Whitman, Pete Wilson, and Dianne Feinstein are just a few of the public officials who have been forced to acknowledge that they employed undocumented immigrants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The news that a New Jersey golf course owned by President Trump, who has made border security and the fight to protect jobs for Americans a cornerstone of his presidency, had been employing undocumented immigrants as housekeepers was far from the first such revelation about a prominent public official.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/us/11undocpolitics-01/merlin_142169565_f66ea6d3-0d09-4098-8930-d06eec429095-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/11/us/11undocpolitics-01/merlin_142169565_f66ea6d3-0d09-4098-8930-d06eec429095-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/us/11undocpolitics-01/merlin_142169565_f66ea6d3-0d09-4098-8930-d06eec429095-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/us/11undocpolitics-01/merlin_142169565_f66ea6d3-0d09-4098-8930-d06eec429095-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/11/us/11undocpolitics-01/11undocpolitics-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/11/us/11undocpolitics-01/11undocpolitics-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumb