 recklessness?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/11/opinion/brazil-health-care-bolsonaro.html', 'snippet': 'Our public health system is a jewel. Can it survive four years of recklessness?', 'lead_paragraph': 'SÃO PAULO, Brazil — A few weeks ago, the Cuban government announced it would withdraw from the Brazilian medical program Mais Médicos, which sends doctors to remote, underserved areas in Brazil. It’s estimated that millions of citizens could be deprived of primary health care after the departure of roughly 8,600 Cuban doctors from the country. The decision was prompted by demeaning remarks made by Brazil’s right-wing president-elect, Jair Bolsonaro.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/12/opinion/12BARBARA/merlin_147197931_8dc1a4b7-ea43-47fb-a58e-5d6024e1015d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/12/opinion/12BARBARA/merlin_147197931_8dc1a4b7-ea43-47fb-a58e-5d6024e1015d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/12/opinion/12BARBARA/merlin_147197931_8dc1a4b7-ea43-47fb-a58e-5d6024e1015d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/12/opinion/12BARBARA/merlin_147197931_8dc1a4b7-ea43-47fb-a58e-5d6024e1015d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1339, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/12/opinion/12BARBARA/12BARBARA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thu