: None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/1761cce0-fdb1-5ae0-9599-281241601d19', 'word_count': 1142, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1761cce0-fdb1-5ae0-9599-281241601d19'}, {'abstract': 'House and Senate negotiators, after months of talks, reached a deal to change and toughen the arcane rules governing sexual misconduct claims on Capitol Hill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/12/us/politics/sexual-harassment-capitol-hill.html', 'snippet': 'House and Senate negotiators, after months of talks, reached a deal to change and toughen the arcane rules governing sexual misconduct claims on Capitol Hill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — After months of stalled negotiations, lawmakers in the House and Senate reached a compromise on legislation that would overhaul the arcane and often burdensome procedures for handling sexual harassment and discrimination claims in Congress.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/13/us/politics/13dc-harass/merlin_148066821_945dc39e-89d4-40dd-a77a-a391181d464f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/13/us/politics/13dc-harass/merlin_148066821_945dc39e-89d4-40dd-a77a-a391181d464f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/13/us/politics/13dc-harass/merlin_148066821_945dc39e-89d4-40dd-a77a-a391181d464f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/13/us/politics/13dc-harass/merlin_148066821_945dc39e-89d4-40dd-a7