'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/edb8567d-b476-5439-a2f9-94857f255c27', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/edb8567d-b476-5439-a2f9-94857f255c27'}, {'abstract': 'It’s less infantile than you’d think. Like daydreams, playing with stuffed animals offers pure delight — a chance to doodle with your emotions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/13/magazine/letter-of-recommendation-stuffed-animals.html', 'snippet': 'It’s less infantile than you’d think. Like daydreams, playing with stuffed animals offers pure delight — a chance to doodle with your emotions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every night I spend a few minutes catching up with my friends. I saw them during the day — maybe one rode along with me on my long commute, or relaxed nearby while I worked from home. But this last check-in closes the evening nicely. I talk to them, imagine what they might be thinking. I pick them up and play out their whims.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/16/magazine/16mag-LOR/16mag-LOR-articleLarge.png', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/16/magazine/16mag-LOR/16mag-LOR-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/16/magazine/16mag-LOR/16mag-LOR-jumbo.png', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/16/magazine/16mag-LOR/16mag-LOR-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1490, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 