Spanish actor Gustavo Salmerón stitches together an affectionate, frank portrait of his indomitable mother in this family documentary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This movie introduces its heroine on what looks like her deathbed, as she gives someone behind the camera instructions for her funeral. But the nearly 90 minutes that follow might convince a viewer that Julita Salmerón, whose son, the Spanish actor Gustavo Salmerón, directed this frank and affectionate portrait, will live forever.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/14/movies/14lotsofkids1/merlin_147856074_84a629fa-cf62-43bd-83a3-85bb9b540db8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/14/movies/14lotsofkids1/merlin_147856074_84a629fa-cf62-43bd-83a3-85bb9b540db8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/14/movies/14lotsofkids1/merlin_147856074_84a629fa-cf62-43bd-83a3-85bb9b540db8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/14/movies/14lotsofkids1/merlin_147856074_84a629fa-cf62-43bd-83a3-85bb9b540db8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/14/movies/14lotsofkids1/14lotsofkids1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/14/movies/14lotsofkids1/14lotsofkids1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai