 will likely be run for a time by David Bernhardt, a man who has played a central role in opening up public lands to drilling and mining.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/15/climate/zinke-interior-successor-bernhardt.html', 'snippet': "With the Interior secretary's departure, the agency will likely be run for a time by David Bernhardt, a man who has played a central role in opening up public lands to drilling and mining.", 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — With Interior Secretary Ryan Zinke departing at the end of the year, the agency will likely be run, at least for a time, by its deputy secretary, David Bernhardt, a former oil lobbyist who has played a central role in enacting President Trump’s agenda of rolling back conservation measures and opening up public lands to drilling and mining.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/climate/00CLI-BERNHARDT1/merlin_141746703_6ba44b30-44b5-4120-a559-8b814eed7386-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/09/climate/00CLI-BERNHARDT1/merlin_141746703_6ba44b30-44b5-4120-a559-8b814eed7386-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/climate/00CLI-BERNHARDT1/merlin_141746703_6ba44b30-44b5-4120-a559-8b814eed7386-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/climate/00CLI-BERNHARDT1/merlin_141746703_6ba44b30-44b5-4120-a559-8b814eed7386-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 