ne, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/a6a70f57-ecb6-588c-a7da-4c870706c04b', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/a6a70f57-ecb6-588c-a7da-4c870706c04b'}, {'abstract': 'Use of other drugs, including opioids, alcohol and tobacco cigarettes, was down and marijuana use was steady, the annual survey of American teenagers found.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/17/health/ecigarettes-teens-nicotine-.html', 'snippet': 'Use of other drugs, including opioids, alcohol and tobacco cigarettes, was down and marijuana use was steady, the annual survey of American teenagers found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A steep rise in nicotine vaping over the past year, accompanied by widespread minimizing of its potential harm, dominated the findings of a closely watched annual survey of American teenagers, released Monday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/18/science/18VAPING/merlin_142718061_bf275235-d100-46be-821f-85c250997846-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/18/science/18VAPING/merlin_142718061_bf275235-d100-46be-821f-85c250997846-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/18/science/18VAPING/merlin_142718061_bf275235-d100-46be-821f-85c250997846-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/18/science/18VAPING/merlin_142718061_bf275235-d100-46be-821f-85c250997846-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 's