l': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/17/us/politics/justice-department-trump-emoluments.html', 'snippet': 'The government asked an appeals court to throw the case out or at least block an order that the Trump hotel in Washington produce financial records.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Justice Department asked a federal appeals court on Monday to throw out or at least temporarily halt a lawsuit that accuses President Trump of illegally benefiting from his family’s business, seeking to block more than three dozen subpoenas for documents from the Trump Organization, the president’s trust and other entities.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/18/us/politics/18dc-emoluments-print/merlin_143639874_5afa2c72-79f3-40e5-93ea-0dfbc7264af3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/18/us/politics/18dc-emoluments-print/merlin_143639874_5afa2c72-79f3-40e5-93ea-0dfbc7264af3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/18/us/politics/18dc-emoluments-print/merlin_143639874_5afa2c72-79f3-40e5-93ea-0dfbc7264af3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/18/us/politics/18dc-emoluments-print/merlin_143639874_5afa2c72-79f3-40e5-93ea-0dfbc7264af3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1421, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/18/us/politics/18dc-emoluments-print/18dc-emoluments-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 7