ews', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8cbf63e-860f-5afb-97a6-eb27123f32e9', 'word_count': 780, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8cbf63e-860f-5afb-97a6-eb27123f32e9'}, {'abstract': 'For the holidays, one showstopping dessert rises above the rest: the Yule log, or bûche de Noël. Yotam Ottolenghi shares his for the season (along with a slightly simpler cake too). ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/17/dining/yule-log-recipe-ottolenghi.html', 'snippet': 'For the holidays, one showstopping dessert rises above the rest: the Yule log, or bûche de Noël. Yotam Ottolenghi shares his for the season (along with a slightly simpler cake too). ', 'lead_paragraph': 'We are in a month of celebrations, which means that extra resources are channeled into the kitchen. Those of us who don’t normally spend time discussing recipes, menus and table settings are busy making sure that they don’t fail the good-host test. Cooking aficionados are also upping their games, hoping to prove that theirs is the clearest broth, the tenderest turkey, the smoothest mash. Like it or not, these are the meals we all remember.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/19/dining/19ottolenghi1/19ottolenghi1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/19/dining/19ottolenghi1/19ottolenghi1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/19/dining/19ottolenghi1/19ottolenghi1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/19/dining/19ottolenghi1/19ottolenghi1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048