ager, besotted with Christmas and its trappings. One year, he unwrapped a gift from his mother and was delighted to find a cylindrical lamp, decorated with Santa and his sleigh; heat from a bulb inside set the image spinning as if by magic. Mr. Bradley learned years later that the gift he’d been given was a rare Econolite motion lamp.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/arts/21showwall/21showwall-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/21/arts/21showwall/21showwall-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/arts/21showwall/21showwall-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/arts/21showwall/21showwall-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/arts/21showwall/21showwall-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/21/arts/21showwall/21showwall-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/arts/21showwall/21showwall-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'His Passion Emerges Annually. He Hangs It on a Tree. Or Three.', 'kicker': 'Show Us Your Wall', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Everyday Passion for an Annual Event', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bradley, Benjamin W', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-18T15:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Warren Strugatch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Warren', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strugatch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0028e455-14cf-5346-9274-f613c0de33f0', 'word_count': 688, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0028e455-14cf-5346-9274-f613c0de33f0'}, {'abstract': 'The United States has the opportunity to incubate technologies that could enable a digital transnational currency of the future.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/18/business/dealbook/digital-reserve-currency.html', 'snippet': 'The United States has the opportunity to incubate technologies that could enable a digital transnational currency of the future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After spending decades as the dominant global reserve currency, the dollar’s position is being challenged.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/19/business/19db-crypto/merlin_147849435_a4228c63-d5a4-4255-893a-db42e8e0ed4c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/19/business/19db-crypto/merlin_147849435_a4228c63-d5a4-4255-893a-db42e8e0ed4c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'r