pened, many with massive renovations and improvements that should draw crowds this holiday season — and help restore local economies. Here, a rundown of some of the most notable comebacks in the islands.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/t-magazine/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/05/t-magazine/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/t-magazine/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/t-magazine/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/t-magazine/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/05/t-magazine/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/05/t-magazine/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6/05tmag-caribbean-hotels-slide-HSI6-