.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/18/us/deer-hunting-bambi-sentence.html', 'snippet': 'David H. Berry Jr. was ordered to watch the Disney classic every month as part of a one-year jail sentence for his role in a operation believed to have killed hundreds of deer, officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the 1942 Disney movie “Bambi,” the little fawn is wobbling on stick-thin legs as it runs through the forest, urged on ahead of its mother after she hears a gunshot. Eventually, Bambi stops and turns around. “We made it!” Bambi says.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/19/us/19xp-deer/merlin_148256331_d21f9625-d421-472d-88fb-ea70dd4c68a3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/19/us/19xp-deer/merlin_148256331_d21f9625-d421-472d-88fb-ea70dd4c68a3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/19/us/19xp-deer/merlin_148256331_d21f9625-d421-472d-88fb-ea70dd4c68a3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/19/us/19xp-deer/merlin_148256331_d21f9625-d421-472d-88fb-ea70dd4c68a3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/19/us/19xp-deer/merlin_148256331_d21f9625-d421-472d-88fb-ea70dd4c68a3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/19/us/19xp-deer/merlin_148256331_d21f9625-d421-472d-88fb-ea70dd4c68a