m of Speech and Expression', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Knowledge', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate Committee on Intelligence', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Interference in 2016 US Elections and Ties to Trump Associates', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-18T20:55:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kara Swisher', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Swisher', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/dfe6b821-0bea-5e9d-acb9-6d92207aed84', 'word_count': 946, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dfe6b821-0bea-5e9d-acb9-6d92207aed84'}, {'abstract': 'Parents, schools and public health experts struggle to find effective ways to help young people quit e-cigarettes. “There is no sound science yet.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/18/health/vaping-nicotine-teenagers.html', 'snippet': 'Parents, schools and public health experts struggle to find effective ways to help young people quit e-cigarettes. “There is no sound science yet.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Harvard addiction medicine specialist is getting calls from distraught parents around the country. A Stanford psychologist is getting calls from rattled school officials around the world. A federal agency has ordered a public hearing on the issue.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/14/science/00VAPEQUIT3/merlin_147696876_269b5598-597b-495f-ab16-c9b1c2e526b3-articleLarge.jpg',