abdd95ba-51b6-577d-bb41-6eeba48ab8ab', 'word_count': 817, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abdd95ba-51b6-577d-bb41-6eeba48ab8ab'}, {'abstract': 'Caviar on white toast celebrates excess while honoring the lean times too.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/19/magazine/caviar-sandwich-holiday-gift.html', 'snippet': 'Caviar on white toast celebrates excess while honoring the lean times too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With my dad, money was always a bit of a wild ride. Sometimes he got the bills paid, but other times he really didn’t. Champagne at Christmas many years; administratively withdrawn from school campuses for unpaid tuition some others. While raising a family of seven on an artist’s mercurial paycheck, he managed some miracles. His genius was in his agility in toggling between the flush and the lean, sometimes in the same year — the five kids piled into the station wagon and taken with our very best table manners to the Russian Tea Room for chicken à la Kiev, for the Rockettes at Radio City, walking Fifth Avenue to the tree — in spite of the electricity’s being shut off or having to siphon gas for the car. With deep practice I’ve learned to braid them into one single experience without having to switch back and forth at all. Caviar for the holidays, yes, but not rolled in on the proper silver cart, with the glittering shaved ice, the warm blini tucked in the white napkin, the mother-of-pearl spoons. I’m saying, rather, a kind of louche, very likable but humbler deal: a sandwich. With domestic farmed caviar, spooned between two thin pieces of white toast, with boiled egg and crème fraîche and chopped scallions in there, too, for an affordable, but luscious and haute, lowbrow sandwich. All at once a little messy and a little decadent and a little modest. As my father would cheerfully say, “Diamonds and burlap!”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/23/magazine/23mag-Eat-image1/23mag-Eat-image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/23/magazine/23mag-Eat-image1/23mag-Eat-image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/23/magazine/23mag-Eat-image1/23mag-Eat-image1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/23/magazine/23mag-Eat-image1/23mag-Eat-image1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/23/magazine/23mag-Eat-image1/23mag-Eat-image1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/23/magazine/23mag-Eat-image1/23mag-Eat-image1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/23/magazine/23mag-Eat-image1/23mag-Eat-image1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Sandwich Is a Luxurious Holiday Gift to You', 'kicker': 'Eat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Diamonds and Burlap', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Caviar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New Year', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Valentine's Day", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-19T10:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gabrielle Hamilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gabrielle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hamilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d0d59cd-eec1-5fd9-932a-74ad4107151c', 'word_count': 764, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d0d59cd-eec1-5fd9-932a-74ad4107151c'}, {'abstract': 'Log cabin perfumes are here to make your winter extra cozy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/19/style/perfume-winter-fragrances.html', 'snippet': 'Log cabin perfumes are here to make your winter extra cozy.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I bloom indoors in the winter like a forced forsythia,” the author and naturalist Annie Dillard wrote in 1973. “I come in to come out.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/20/fashion/20skin/merlin_147977130_7c71e439-3877-4109-b3b5-99e23dcb3a94-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/20/fashion/20skin/merlin_147977130_7c71e439-3877-4109-b3b5-99e23dcb3a94-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/20/fashion/20skin/merlin_147977130_7c71e439-3877-4109-b3b5-99e23dcb3a94-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018