 to throw out sex-crime charges against the Hollywood producer for investigative mistakes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/20/nyregion/harvey-weinstein-case-sexual-assault.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Weinstein’s lawyers failed to persuade a judge to throw out sex-crime charges against the Hollywood producer for investigative mistakes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Harvey Weinstein arrived in a Manhattan courtroom on Thursday morning hoping a state judge would throw out the remaining criminal charges against him. Several Hollywood actresses sat in the gallery, hoping for the opposite outcome.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/nyregion/21weinstein2/merlin_148355406_f08fa8e9-68a3-429a-b774-297a68fe047a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/21/nyregion/21weinstein2/merlin_148355406_f08fa8e9-68a3-429a-b774-297a68fe047a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/nyregion/21weinstein2/merlin_148355406_f08fa8e9-68a3-429a-b774-297a68fe047a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/nyregion/21weinstein2/merlin_148355406_f08fa8e9-68a3-429a-b774-297a68fe047a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/nyregion/21weinstein2/21weinstein2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'th