e/0530d50a-a31a-5afb-b401-e7dedef0ba43'}, {'abstract': 'The video showed the president onstage during the 2005 Emmy Awards with the comedian Megan Mullally singing the theme song from “Green Acres.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/20/us/politics/trump-megan-mullally-video-green-acres.html', 'snippet': 'The video showed the president onstage during the 2005 Emmy Awards with the comedian Megan Mullally singing the theme song from “Green Acres.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In two hours on Thursday, President Trump publicly unveiled an expansive farm bill, railed against the dangers of illegal immigration, fought with Congress over funding for a border wall and announced the departure of Jim Mattis, his defense secretary, who is resigning over what he regards as the president’s ill-planned decision to pull back American troops from Syria.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/reader-center/21DC-TRUMPrefer/merlin_148363746_2bf84377-f913-4cc1-9d38-b34048f1415c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/21/reader-center/21DC-TRUMPrefer/merlin_148363746_2bf84377-f913-4cc1-9d38-b34048f1415c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/reader-center/21DC-TRUMPrefer/merlin_148363746_2bf84377-f913-4cc1-9d38-b34048f1415c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/21/reader-center/21DC-TRUMPrefer/merlin_148363746_2bf84377-f913-4cc1-9d38-b34048f1415c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1125, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'cro