ract': 'Seattle plans to tear down the Alaskan Way Viaduct, the hulking, elevated road through downtown. The mayor anticipates “a collective gasp.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/21/us/seattle-alaskan-way-viaduct.html', 'snippet': 'Seattle plans to tear down the Alaskan Way Viaduct, the hulking, elevated road through downtown. The mayor anticipates “a collective gasp.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE — Kurt Cobain performed in a grubby club underneath it. Drivers called it a road of kings, four wide open lanes far above the pedestrian horde. And generations of Seattle residents felt a shiver of romance in the moody shadows it cast over a waterfront already famous for gray skies and gloom.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/20/us/00seattle1/merlin_148331163_7584691b-0d6e-41e9-98d6-30f5ae46bcf3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/20/us/00seattle1/merlin_148331163_7584691b-0d6e-41e9-98d6-30f5ae46bcf3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/20/us/00seattle1/merlin_148331163_7584691b-0d6e-41e9-98d6-30f5ae46bcf3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/20/us/00seattle1/merlin_148331163_7584691b-0d6e-41e9-98d6-30f5ae46bcf3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/20/us/00seattle1/00seattle1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,