hopping.html', 'snippet': 'Amazon’s power is even more pronounced in the nail-biter sprint toward Christmas. A two-decade obsession with delivery speed has given it a huge edge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE — Olivia Zimmermann started her holiday shopping early this year, buying a Bluetooth speaker from Best Buy for her sister. It was supposed to arrive by Dec. 10, two weeks before Christmas.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/22/business/22AMAZON02/merlin_148360563_47aa7621-2ad4-4b47-af03-4148b70a7bd1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/22/business/22AMAZON02/merlin_148360563_47aa7621-2ad4-4b47-af03-4148b70a7bd1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/22/business/22AMAZON02/merlin_148360563_47aa7621-2ad4-4b47-af03-4148b70a7bd1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/22/business/22AMAZON02/merlin_148360563_47aa7621-2ad4-4b47-af03-4148b70a7bd1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/22/business/22AMAZON02/merlin_148360563_47aa7621-2ad4-4b47-af03-4148b70a7bd1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/22/business/22AMAZON02/merlin_148360563_47aa7621-2ad4-4b47-af03-4148b70a7bd1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'r