ms to formerly unwanted common weeds, the best arrangements featured in T in 2018. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/21/t-magazine/best-flowers.html', 'snippet': 'From showy anthuriums to formerly unwanted common weeds, the best arrangements featured in T in 2018. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'From common weeds like the wild dandelion and the formerly despised anthurium — also known as “penis on a platter,” as Deborah Needleman wrote in her story about the resurgence of ’80s floral arrangements — many previously unfashionable flowers came back into vogue this year. Accordingly, the pages of T were filled with unexpected arrangements, including clouds of Queen Anne’s lace, swathes of Japanese knotweed and vases of rainbow-colored baby’s breath, pastel-dyed orchids and flamboyant birds of paradise. Click through our slide show to see some of the best flowers we featured in 2018.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/t-magazine/03tmag-hicart-slide-73Y7/03tmag-hicart-slide-73Y7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 435, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/03/t-magazine/03tmag-hicart-slide-73Y7/03tmag-hicart-slide-73Y7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 435}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/t-magazine/03tmag-hicart-slide-73Y7/03tmag-hicart-slide-73Y7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 742, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/t-magazine/03tmag-hicart-slide-73Y7/03tmag-hicart-slide-73Y7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1484, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,