, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ad33f8e-2869-5152-916b-907410c507dc'}, {'abstract': 'Russian efforts meant to polarize American voters continued during the midterms, the director of national intelligence said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/21/us/politics/russia-midterm-election-influence-coates.html', 'snippet': 'Russian efforts meant to polarize American voters continued during the midterms, the director of national intelligence said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Russian operations meant to polarize American voters continued during the midterm elections, but did not compromise the voting systems used, according to a study by the intelligence community.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/22/us/politics/22dc-intel-1/merlin_146404836_73e8eb9d-1722-4dd6-b9f0-80fbfdbb6e3c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/22/us/politics/22dc-intel-1/merlin_146404836_73e8eb9d-1722-4dd6-b9f0-80fbfdbb6e3c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/22/us/politics/22dc-intel-1/merlin_146404836_73e8eb9d-1722-4dd6-b9f0-80fbfdbb6e3c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/22/us/politics/22dc-intel-1/merlin_146404836_73e8eb9d-1722-4dd6-b9f0-80fbfdbb6e3c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/22/us/politics/22dc-intel-1/22dc-intel-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'he