 over the past 20 years. About actual wars between Israel and the Gaza Strip, and about intellectual wars between creationists and scientists. About political campaigns and school shootings. About a small town in the Midwest that tried to ban lying, and a small hummus place in the Mideast that tried to promote peace.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/world/22readers-steer/merlin_147415998_06a68ebf-ed74-4caa-95fb-6f87efd9413b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/30/world/22readers-steer/merlin_147415998_06a68ebf-ed74-4caa-95fb-6f87efd9413b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/world/22readers-steer/merlin_147415998_06a68ebf-ed74-4caa-95fb-6f87efd9413b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/world/22readers-steer/merlin_147415998_06a68ebf-ed74-4caa-95fb-6f87efd9413b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1345, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/world/22readers-steer/29xp-steer-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/30/world/22readers-steer/29xp-steer-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/world/22readers-steer/29xp-steer-1-t