r buy some blinds. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q: My Manhattan apartment has a direct view of the terrace of a co-op penthouse apartment one block away. The terrace has two bright floodlights that shine directly into my living room and bedroom. I cannot watch television unless I tape newspaper on the window to block the light. I spoke with the managing agent of the other building and was told that the shareholder would try to limit the use of the floodlights. But the situation has not improved. Before I buy window blinds that I do not want, is there another remedy?', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/23/realestate/23Ask-Illo/merlin_148293345_f31eeb09-8136-4b1a-9ed7-014c18ee0066-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 117, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/23/realestate/23Ask-Illo/merlin_148293345_f31eeb09-8136-4b1a-9ed7-014c18ee0066-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 117}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/23/realestate/23Ask-Illo/merlin_148293345_f31eeb09-8136-4b1a-9ed7-014c18ee0066-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 200, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/23/realestate/23Ask-Illo/merlin_148293345_f31eeb09-8136-4b1a-9ed7-014c18ee0066-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/23/realestate/23Ask-Illo/merlin_148293345_f31eeb09-8136-4b1a-9ed7-014c18ee0066-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy