.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/23/arts/baby-its-cold-outside-responses.html', 'snippet': 'Readers (and one rock star) answered our questions about how to balance a love of classic movies and songs, like “Baby, It’s Cold Outside,” with the cringing they can produce.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometimes movies or songs don’t age well, but you find yourself watching or humming along to them anyway, offensive lyrics, wince-inducing scenes and all. That is especially true during the holiday season, when traditions and modern sensibilities collide in an acute way.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28babyitscold-responses/merlin_148394724_127a6806-6769-42db-a95b-37553c749526-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28babyitscold-responses/merlin_148394724_127a6806-6769-42db-a95b-37553c749526-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28babyitscold-responses/merlin_148394724_127a6806-6769-42db-a95b-37553c749526-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1023, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28babyitscold-responses/merlin_148394724_127a6806-6769-42db-a95b-37553c749526-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1023, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28babyitscold-responses/24babyitscold-responses-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStan