 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Selling Real Estate in Russia? Are You Insane, or Just Drunk?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate Brokers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Moscow (Russia)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-25T20:51:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew E. Kramer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Kramer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/28500b1e-e28f-53e2-ae03-f1c0e4af2a5c', 'word_count': 1230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28500b1e-e28f-53e2-ae03-f1c0e4af2a5c'}, {'abstract': 'Ball grew up idolizing LeBron James. Now they are teammates on the Lakers, one 21 years old and the other about to turn 34. It is all a work in progress.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/25/sports/lonzo-ball-lebron-james-lakers.html', 'snippet': 'Ball grew up idolizing LeBron James. Now they are teammates on the Lakers, one 21 years old and the other about to turn 34. It is all a work in progress.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OAKLAND, Calif. — Lonzo Ball began to revere LeBron James when James was a first-year forward with the Cleveland Cavaliers, which would have made Ball about 6 years old at the time. But Ball, as he put it himself in an interview last week, “idolized” James so much, even then, that he had a youth-size replica of one of his jerseys.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/26/sports/26lonzo-web1/merlin_147993483_80a9840e-1e87-4bf5-a20f-c94b192bf486-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/26/sports/26lonzo-web1/merlin_147993483_80a9840e-1e87-4bf5-a20f-c94b192bf486-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/26/sports/26lonzo-web1/merlin_147993483_80a9840e-1e87-4bf5-a20f-c94b192bf486-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/26/sports/26lonzo-web1/merlin_147993483_80a9840e-1e87-4bf5-a20f-c94b192bf486-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1472, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/26/sports/26lonzo-web1/26lonzo-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/26/sports/26lonzo-web1/26lonzo-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/26/sports/26lonzo-web1/26lonzo-web1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lonzo Ball Strives to Be a Point Guard Fit for a King', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Guard Fit to Serve L.A.’s King', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'v