ese were inhospitable areas ridden with predators and imposing, hellish granite outcrops.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/arts/30brigman-01/merlin_146832528_338e9c82-1ff7-45e4-bb5c-d1be54354be4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 782, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/30/arts/30brigman-01/merlin_146832528_338e9c82-1ff7-45e4-bb5c-d1be54354be4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 782}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/arts/30brigman-01/merlin_146832528_338e9c82-1ff7-45e4-bb5c-d1be54354be4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 786, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/arts/30brigman-01/merlin_146832528_338e9c82-1ff7-45e4-bb5c-d1be54354be4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1572, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/arts/30brigman-01/30brigman-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/30/arts/30brigman-01/30brigman-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/arts/30brigman-01/30brigman-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Pioneering Photographer, Bare in the Back Country', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In the S