material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a81b310-7f40-5541-8896-334d2900a08e', 'word_count': 3593, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a81b310-7f40-5541-8896-334d2900a08e'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Langton, who believed that a novel’s meaning “comes from an organic relationship with its setting,” also wrote children’s books and often did her own illustrations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/26/obituaries/jane-langton-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Langton, who believed that a novel’s meaning “comes from an organic relationship with its setting,” also wrote children’s books and often did her own illustrations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jane Langton, a prolific New England author who evoked a palpable sense of place in her mysteries and children’s books, and who illustrated many of her works herself, died on Saturday in hospice care near her home in Lincoln, Mass. She was 95.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/29/obituaries/29LANGTON-OBIT1-SUB/merlin_148481748_7096fb52-f7ec-4296-b9d9-77c997d5c52d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/29/obituaries/29LANGTON-OBIT1-SUB/merlin_148481748_7096fb52-f7ec-4296-b9d9-77c997d5c52d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/29/obituaries/29LANGTON-OBIT1-SUB/merlin_148481748_7096fb52-f7ec-4296-b9d9-77c997d5c52d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/29/obituaries/29LANGTON-OBIT1-SUB/merlin_148481748_7096fb52-f7ec-4296-b9d9-77c997d5c52d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'super