med essays.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/26/style/modern-love-podcast-margarita-levieva-pamela-adlon.html', 'snippet': 'In a special episode, the Modern Love podcast presents three holiday-themed essays.', 'lead_paragraph': '’Tis the season. This week the Modern Love podcast pulls together three holiday-themed essays into a playlist that is perfect for long car rides and airport delays. Tune in to hear actors Margarita Levieva, Pamela Adlon and Darby Stanchfield read stories that feature an indoor snow machine, a cuddle party and a Christmas hunting adventure.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/29/fashion/22MODERNLOVE_SPAN/22MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/29/fashion/22MODERNLOVE_SPAN/22MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/29/fashion/22MODERNLOVE_SPAN/22MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/29/fashion/22MODERNLOVE_SPAN/22MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1323, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/29/fashion/22MODERNLOVE_SPAN/22MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/29/fashion/22MODERNLOVE_SPAN/22MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/29/fashion/22MODERNLOVE_SPAN/22MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Margarita Levieva, Pamela Adlon and Darby Stanchfield Read From Modern Love', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Podcasts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-26T22:28:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6cca2f98-f034-56b2-b361-818395b54ddc', 'word_count': 82, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6cca2f98-f034-56b2-b361-818395b54ddc'}, {'abstract': 'Denise Murrell’s interest in art, and its treatment of black people, led her to change careers and organize the exhibition “Posing Modernity.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/26/arts/design/posing-modernity-curator-manet-olympia.html', 'snippet': 'Denise Murrell’s interest in art, and its treatment of black people, led her to change careers and organize the exhibition “Posing Modernity.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the curator Denise Murrell talks about Édouard Manet, she races through the details of his life, sometimes abruptly changing course to parse less-discussed aspects of his art — often in disbelief that she’s among the few who have paid attention to these parts of him. After she has so convincingly retold his life story, you can’t help but see what she considers obvious: In his famous 1863 painting “Olympia,” Manet wanted the black maid to stand out.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28murrell-04/merlin_145830693_75a80425-4030-44c9-8845-cfd382f51b