 'uri': 'nyt://article/289d362f-a620-50ac-8358-07efc8e4e119'}, {'abstract': 'The 15 short films here are mostly well-executed, our critic writes. But only a few push boundaries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/27/movies/the-20th-annual-animation-show-of-shows-review.html', 'snippet': 'The 15 short films here are mostly well-executed, our critic writes. But only a few push boundaries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In my view, at least, the best short-form animation — like the most memorable short stories — is daring in perspective and malleable in interpretation. And while the 15 short films on view in “The 20th Annual Animation Show of Shows” are mostly charming and invariably well-executed, only a handful push outside their carefully drawn lines.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28animationshow/28animationshow-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 255, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28animationshow/28animationshow-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 255}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28animationshow/28animationshow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 435, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28animationshow/28animationshow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 648, 'width': 1524, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/28/arts/28animationshow/28animationshow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legac