ue': 'Design', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-27T14:02:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/905c1c54-f9fc-5101-86c2-70f516614e94', 'word_count': 93, 'uri': 'nyt://article/905c1c54-f9fc-5101-86c2-70f516614e94'}, {'abstract': 'Thursday: How surviving the Borderline and Las Vegas shootings shaped a young man, the definition of a wall and 36 hours in underappreciated cities', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/27/us/california-today-thousand-oaks-mass-shooting-afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'Thursday: How surviving the Borderline and Las Vegas shootings shaped a young man, the definition of a wall and 36 hours in underappreciated cities', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/us/27survivorcatoday/merlin_148376034_aaff4cbb-b4da-4567-a0fa-4a6ed32da6e1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/27/us/27survivorcatoday/merlin_148376034_aaff4cbb-b4da-4567-a0fa-4a6ed32da6e1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/us/27survivorcatoday/merlin_148376034_aaff4cbb-b4da-4567-a0fa-4a6ed32da6e1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/us/27survivorcatoday/merlin_148376034_aaff4cbb-b4da-4567-a0fa-4a6ed32da6e1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/us/27survivorcatoday/00survivor-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/27/us/27survivorcatoday/00survivor-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/us/27survivorcatoday/00survivor-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'California Today: Surviving Two Mass Shootings, and Then Deploying', 'kicker': 'California Today', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2018-12-27T14:11:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jill Cowan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/761eb6c5-e861-5972-b49e-f81fa3056268', 'word_count': 1037, 'uri': 'nyt://article/761eb6c5-e861-5972-b49e-f81fa3056268'}, {'abstract': 'Wendy Ouriel, the founder of the organic beauty brand Oumere, developed her first product while studying black widow spiders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/27/t-magazine/oumere-skin-care.html', 'snippet': 'Wendy Ouriel, the founder of the organic beauty brand Oumere, developed her first product while studying black widow spiders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For at least half a decade, a handful of beauty ingredients and treatments have reigned supreme: retinol, hyaluronic acid, vitamin C, microdermabrasion, lasers. Wendy Ouriel, the creator of the Los Angeles-based organic skin-care line Oumere — an amalgamation of her surname and “telomere,” the compound at the end of chromosomes that prevents DNA strands from unraveling — takes issue with all of the above. A trained cellular biologist, Ouriel believes the treatments to be damaging on the cellular level — and what is aging if not the accumulation of cellular damage over time? Since launching her brand in 2016, and her blog, Bioluminescence, a year later, she’s become a sort of skin-care renegade, amassing a devoted fan base that includes China Chow and the artist Katerina Jebb. Dover Street Market recently stocked Oumere, which is also available at Sally Hershberger, for its new store in downtown L.A.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/t-magazine/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/27/t-magazine/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/t-magazine/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/t-magazine/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/t-magazine/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/27/t-magazine/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/27/t-magazine/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5/27tmag-oumere-slide-48K5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Brand to Know: A Skin-Care Line by a Cellular Biologist', 'kicker': 'On the Verge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Skin Renegade', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beauty (Concept)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-27T14:17:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Guadagnino', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Guadagnino', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/116e3e2c-4db9-55b4-a142-dc2b23ad1abf', 'word_count': 740, 'uri': 'nyt://article/116e3e2c-4db9-55b4-a142-dc2b23ad1abf'}, {'abstract': 'With the exception of collectible vehicles, Vespa scooters hold their value better than anything else on the road.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/27/business/vespa-scooters-resale-values.html', 'snippet': 'With the exception of collectible vehicles, Vespa scooters hold their value better than anything else on the road.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every year, J. D. Power highlights the automobiles that retain the highest percentage of their original pric