k: The value of sustained attention it is.) Attention is expressly the subject of Uwe Johnson’s vast diaristic novel “Anniversaries,” as Parul Sehgal notes in her impressed and impressive review. I haven’t read Johnson’s book yet; I’m still stalled out in the Nighttown section of “Ulysses,” so in my side reading lately I tend to favor digestible chunks of essays or stories. But I’ve heard good things about it for months, and Parul’s review convinces me I should add it to my list. You should, too. You can start right away, if you’re not reading “Ulysses.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/books/review/30ed-covers/30ed-covers-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 311, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/30/books/review/30ed-covers/30ed-covers-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 311}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/books/review/30ed-covers/30ed-covers-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 531, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/books/review/30ed-covers/30ed-covers-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 612, 'width': 1180, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/books/review/30ed-covers/30ed-covers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/30/books/review/30ed-covers/30ed-covers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cred