rs announced layoffs, even as the $1.5 trillion tax cut added billions to their bottom lines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/27/us/politics/trump-tax-cuts-jobs-act.html', 'snippet': 'Many corporations made good on promises to raise wages and pay bonuses. But others announced layoffs, even as the $1.5 trillion tax cut added billions to their bottom lines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was a point in early 2018 when big American companies couldn’t stop talking about the Trump tax cuts. Flush with the projected savings from a $1.5 trillion law, they promised to raise wages, hand out bonuses to workers and invest in big projects. They scored headlines, along with applause from President Trump. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/26/business/00dc-tax-01/merlin_148109886_9eb726c9-8aab-4944-afff-bc0edf638336-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/26/business/00dc-tax-01/merlin_148109886_9eb726c9-8aab-4944-afff-bc0edf638336-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/26/business/00dc-tax-01/merlin_148109886_9eb726c9-8aab-4944-afff-bc0edf638336-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 722, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/26/business/00dc-tax-01/merlin_148109886_9eb726c9-8aab-4944-afff-bc0edf638336-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1410, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/26/business/00dc-tax-01/00dc-tax-01-thumbStan