e most famous crystal ball in the world. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/28/nyregion/the-man-behind-the-times-square-ball.html', 'snippet': 'Tom Brennan, who comes from a working-class family in a small Irish town, is the master artisan in charge of the most famous crystal ball in the world. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'For much of the past 111 years, the sparkling New Year’s Eve Times Square ball has been a signal for the 1.2 billion people watching it across the globe to dance, cheer, blow their horns, and embrace. It has become such a touchstone that it almost seems like another year can’t start without it.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/nyregion/30ball/merlin_148381035_b3abef3f-d63b-46de-b2da-4d4528af6e14-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/30/nyregion/30ball/merlin_148381035_b3abef3f-d63b-46de-b2da-4d4528af6e14-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/nyregion/30ball/merlin_148381035_b3abef3f-d63b-46de-b2da-4d4528af6e14-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/nyregion/30ball/merlin_148381035_b3abef3f-d63b-46de-b2da-4d4528af6e14-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/nyregion/30ball/merlin_148381035_b3abef3f-d63b-46de-b2da-4d4528af6e14-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_