353-5131-b5b1-e1a3379b59a6'}, {'abstract': 'What my mother’s death taught me about the health care system America needs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/29/opinion/sunday/kamala-harris-affordable-care-act-medicare.html', 'snippet': 'What my mother’s death taught me about the health care system America needs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2008, our mother asked my sister, Maya, and me to meet her for lunch. When we arrived, our mother didn’t seem like herself. We wondered what was going on. Then she took a deep breath and reached out to us both across the table.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/opinion/sunday/30harris/merlin_145210761_5763ee1e-7118-4ab3-98ae-344353c96730-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/30/opinion/sunday/30harris/merlin_145210761_5763ee1e-7118-4ab3-98ae-344353c96730-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/opinion/sunday/30harris/merlin_145210761_5763ee1e-7118-4ab3-98ae-344353c96730-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/opinion/sunday/30harris/merlin_145210761_5763ee1e-7118-4ab3-98ae-344353c96730-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/opinion/sunday/30harris/30harris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images