l about tech. Maybe that is about to change. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/29/opinion/tech-bubble-bursting-stock-market.html', 'snippet': 'There are nations and industries in sound economic shape that are ignored by investors because they are not all about tech. Maybe that is about to change. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a decade of extraordinary gains, the American stock market has come unhinged in recent weeks, with the technology sector leading the rapid decline. American tech giants are down on average 25 percent from recent peaks, and it appears the big global bubble of the 2010s is bursting. The question on everyone’s mind is what comes next.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/sunday-review/30sharma1/merlin_143333442_a815a983-8ece-4831-8d63-cb4d25d40961-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/30/sunday-review/30sharma1/merlin_143333442_a815a983-8ece-4831-8d63-cb4d25d40961-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/sunday-review/30sharma1/merlin_143333442_a815a983-8ece-4831-8d63-cb4d25d40961-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/sunday-review/30sharma1/merlin_143333442_a815a983-8ece-4831-8d63-cb4d25d40961-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1334, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/30/sunday-review/30sharma1/merlin_143333442_a815a983-8ece-4831-8d63-cb4