_id': 'nyt://article/3a2b0105-efc0-54df-8b48-93c26d6cd069', 'word_count': 994, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a2b0105-efc0-54df-8b48-93c26d6cd069'}, {'abstract': 'Economic and other indicators are making it increasingly clear that Trump’s economic dreams are unlikely to come true.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/31/opinion/trump-2018-charts.html', 'snippet': 'Economic and other indicators are making it increasingly clear that Trump’s economic dreams are unlikely to come true.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By any measure, 2018 was another Year of Trump. From his efforts to remake the American economy to his go-it-alone trade war to his curious pro-Putin foreign policy to the at least 17 investigations underway into his various activities, President Trump dominated the news as few of his predecessors have done. But by the end of his second year, the prospects that he would achieve his economic goals were in grave doubt as growth slowed and the stock market swooned.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/31/opinion/31rattner/31rattner-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/31/opinion/31rattner/31rattner-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/31/opinion/31rattner/31rattner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/31/opinion/31rattner/31rattner-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/31/opinion/