t of a triple bill: “I just love having a single visual image onstage,” she said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/31/theater/cowboy-gracie-gardner-exponential-festival.html', 'snippet': 'Gracie Gardner’s “Cowboy,” which runs from six to 20 minutes, is part of a triple bill: “I just love having a single visual image onstage,” she said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of 2018’s left field hits was Gracie Gardner’s “Athena,” a duel between a pair of teenage fencers and the rare Off Off Broadway production to get an encore staging (both runs were at Jack in Brooklyn).', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/01/arts/01janfest-cowboy/merlin_133990658_bf989eda-046e-4493-9dac-c827db119de9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/01/01/arts/01janfest-cowboy/merlin_133990658_bf989eda-046e-4493-9dac-c827db119de9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/01/arts/01janfest-cowboy/merlin_133990658_bf989eda-046e-4493-9dac-c827db119de9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/01/arts/01janfest-cowboy/merlin_133990658_bf989eda-046e-4493-9dac-c827db119de9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1639, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/01/arts/01janfest-cowboy/01janfest-cowboy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/