research the coffee — has introduced a handy kit for making it. Disposable pour-over filters and convenient single-portion packets of sweetened condensed milk are all you need. The company makes a kit for Thai iced tea with sweetened condensed milk, too, and sells the milk packets separately.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/02/dining/02BurnerNam1/merlin_147731259_8be75b38-9864-403d-be24-8eb1b256f115-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/01/02/dining/02BurnerNam1/merlin_147731259_8be75b38-9864-403d-be24-8eb1b256f115-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/02/dining/02BurnerNam1/merlin_147731259_8be75b38-9864-403d-be24-8eb1b256f115-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/02/dining/02BurnerNam1/merlin_147731259_8be75b38-9864-403d-be24-8eb1b256f115-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1269, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/02/dining/02BurnerNam1/merlin_147731259_8be75b38-9864-403d-be24-8eb1b256f115-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/01/02/dining/02BurnerNam1/merlin_147731259_8be75b38-9864-403d-be24-8eb1b256f115-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/201