nd the cabinet member in charge of migration policy has labeled it a “major incident” fueled by criminal gangs.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/01/us/politics/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS/merlin_148629894_9efa0369-95d3-4afd-bf64-3f9e4eae9843-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/01/01/us/politics/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS/merlin_148629894_9efa0369-95d3-4afd-bf64-3f9e4eae9843-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/01/us/politics/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS/merlin_148629894_9efa0369-95d3-4afd-bf64-3f9e4eae9843-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/01/us/politics/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS/merlin_148629894_9efa0369-95d3-4afd-bf64-3f9e4eae9843-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/01/us/politics/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/01/01/us/politics/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/01/01/us/politics/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS/01BRITAIN-MIGRANTS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Migrants Reach U.K. by Boat, Numbers Are Small but Worry Is Big', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Migrants Reach Britain By Boat, Stirring Fears', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and Africa Migrant Crisis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Asylum, Right of', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'English Channel', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-12-31T20:34:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3aff9822-8644-59da-8de1-6e4fdd47fb29', 'word_count': 839, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3aff9822-8644-59da-8de1-6e4fdd47fb29'}, {'abstract': 'The failure to comply with the request from the global antidoping regulator could mean renewing penalties that kept Russia out of international sport for cheating.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/12/31/sports/russia-doping-wada-deadline.html', 'snippet': 'The failure to comply with the request from the global antidoping regulator could mean renewing penalties that kept Russia out of international sport for cheating.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Russia will miss an end-of-year deadline to turn over data on its athletes to the global regulator of drugs in sports, raising the specter of new penalties